{"type":"message","id":"2e8dddcd","parentId":"6438d8de","timestamp":"2026-03-14T08:28:15.017Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-03-14 16:28 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 作为 Executor Subagent，执行公告抓取：\n\n用 Playwright 访问以下3个网站，每个提取最新的5条公告（标题+日期+链接）：\n\n1. 厦门市人力资源和社会保障局-通知公告: http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/\n2. 厦门科学技术局: http://sti.xm.gov.cn/\n3. 福建省科技厅: http://kjt.fujian.gov.cn/\n\n注意：\n- 如果某个URL访问失败或找不到公告，快速尝试其变体URL（如加 /xxgk/tzgg/）\n- 不要花太多时间调试，优先获取结果\n- 如果遇到问题，输出你遇到了什么问题，然后结束\n\n输出格式（Markdown表格）：\n| # | 标题 | 发布日期 | 链接 |\n\n保存结果到：~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/adaptive-announcement-scraper/.learnings/公告列表-2026-03-14-v2.md"}],"timestamp":1773476895015}}
{"type":"message","id":"aa4096be","parentId":"2e8dddcd","timestamp":"2026-03-14T08:29:40.430Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户要求我作为 Executor Subagent 执行公告抓取任务。需要用 Playwright 访问3个网站，提取最新的5条公告。\n\n让我先创建一个脚本来完成这个任务。我需要：\n1. 使用 Playwright 访问这3个网站\n2. 提取每个网站最新的5条公告（标题+日期+链接）\n3. 保存为 Markdown 表格格式\n\n让我开始编写脚本。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我来执行公告抓取任务。使用 Playwright 访问这3个网站提取公告信息。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fae8eff999894007a4b946df","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/adaptive-announcement-scraper && cat > scrape_announcements.js << 'EOF'\nconst { chromium } = require('playwright');\n\nasync function scrape() {\n  const browser = await chromium.launch({ headless: true });\n  const context = await browser.newContext({\n    userAgent: 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36'\n  });\n  \n  const results = [];\n  \n  // 网站配置\n  const sites = [\n    { name: '厦门市人力资源和社会保障局', url: 'http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/', altUrls: ['http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/', 'http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/tzgg/'] },\n    { name: '厦门科学技术局', url: 'http://sti.xm.gov.cn/', altUrls: ['http://sti.xm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/', 'http://sti.xm.gov.cn/tzgg/'] },\n    { name: '福建省科技厅', url: 'http://kjt.fujian.gov.cn/', altUrls: ['http://kjt.fujian.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/', 'http://kjt.fujian.gov.cn/tzgg/'] }\n  ];\n  \n  for (const site of sites) {\n    console.log(`\\n=== 正在抓取: ${site.name} ===`);\n    let data = null;\n    let triedUrls = [site.url, ...site.altUrls];\n    \n    for (const url of triedUrls) {\n      try {\n        console.log(`尝试: ${url}`);\n        const page = await context.newPage();\n        await page.goto(url, { timeout: 15000, waitUntil: 'domcontentloaded' });\n        \n        // 等待页面加载\n        await page.waitForTimeout(2000);\n        \n        // 提取公告列表 - 尝试多种选择器\n        const announcements = await page.evaluate(() => {\n          const items = [];\n          \n          // 常见的选择器模式\n          const selectors = [\n            'a[href*=\"info\"]', 'a[href*=\"detail\"]', 'a[href*=\"article\"]',\n            '.article-list a', '.news-list a', '.notice-list a',\n            '.list-item a', 'tr a', '.title a'\n          ];\n          \n          // 获取所有链接\n          const links = document.querySelectorAll('a');\n          links.forEach(link => {\n            const text = link.textContent?.trim();\n            const href = link.href;\n            // 过滤有效链接\n            if (text && text.length > 3 && href && href.startsWith('http') && !href.includes('javascript')) {\n              // 尝试找父元素获取日期\n              let date = '';\n              const parent = link.closest('tr') || link.closest('li') || link.closest('div') || link.parentElement;\n              if (parent) {\n                const dateText = parent.textContent?.match(/(\\d{4}[-/年]\\d{1,2}[-/月]\\d{1,2})/);\n                if (dateText) date = dateText[1].replace(/[年月]/g, '-').replace(/日$/, '');\n              }\n              items.push({ title: text, href: href, date: date });\n            }\n          });\n          \n          return items.slice(0, 10); // 获取更多以备筛选\n        });\n        \n        // 按日期排序并取最新5条\n        const validAnnouncements = announcements\n          .filter(a => a.date)\n          .sort((a, b) => b.date.localeCompare(a.date))\n          .slice(0, 5);\n        \n        if (validAnnouncements.length > 0) {\n          data = validAnnouncements;\n          console.log(`成功获取 ${data.length} 条公告`);\n          break;\n        } else {\n          console.log(`未找到有效公告，尝试其他选择器...`);\n          // 再尝试另一种方式\n          const announcements2 = await page.evaluate(() => {\n            const items = [];\n            const rows = document.querySelectorAll('tr, li, .list-item, .article-item');\n            rows.forEach(row => {\n              const link = row.querySelector('a');\n              const text = link?.textContent?.trim();\n              const href = link?.href;\n              if (text && text.length > 3 && href && href.startsWith('http')) {\n                const dateMatch = row.textContent?.match(/(\\d{4}[-/年]\\d{1,2}[-/月]\\d{1,2})/);\n                const date = dateMatch ? dateMatch[1].replace(/[年月]/g, '-').replace(/日$/, '') : '';\n                items.push({ title: text, href: href, date });\n              }\n            });\n            return items;\n          });\n          \n          const valid2 = announcements2.filter(a => a.date).sort((a, b) => b.date.localeCompare(a.date)).slice(0, 5);\n          if (valid2.length > 0) {\n            data = valid2;\n            console.log(`成功获取 ${data.length} 条公告`);\n            break;\n          }\n        }\n        \n        await page.close();\n      } catch (e) {\n        console.log(`失败: ${e.message}`);\n      }\n    }\n    \n    if (data) {\n      results.push({ site: site.name, announcements: data });\n    } else {\n      results.push({ site: site.name, announcements: [], error: '无法获取公告' });\n    }\n  }\n  \n  await browser.close();\n  \n  // 输出结果\n  console.log('\\n\\n=== 最终结果 ===\\n');\n  for (const r of results) {\n    console.log(`\\n## ${r.site}`);\n    if (r.announcements.length > 0) {\n      r.announcements.forEach((a, i) => {\n        console.log(`${i+1}. ${a.title} | ${a.date} | ${a.href}`);\n      });\n    } else {\n      console.log(r.error || '无公告');\n    }\n  }\n  \n  return results;\n}\n\nscrape().then(results => {\n  console.log('\\n--- JSON OUTPUT ---');\n  console.log(JSON.stringify(results, null, 2));\n}).catch(e => {\n  console.error('Error:', e);\n  process.exit(1);\n});\nEOF\nnode scrape_announcements.js","timeout":120}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773476895016}}
{"type":"message","id":"b99d109b","parentId":"aa4096be","timestamp":"2026-03-14T08:30:17.410Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_fae8eff999894007a4b946df","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 正在抓取: 厦门市人力资源和社会保障局 ===\n尝试: http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/\n未找到有效公告，尝试其他选择器...\n成功获取 5 条公告\n\n=== 正在抓取: 厦门科学技术局 ===\n尝试: http://sti.xm.gov.cn/\n失败: page.goto: Timeout 15000ms exceeded.\nCall log:\n  - navigating to \"http://sti.xm.gov.cn/\", waiting until \"domcontentloaded\"\n\n尝试: http://sti.xm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/\n未找到有效公告，尝试其他选择器...\n成功获取 5 条公告\n\n=== 正在抓取: 福建省科技厅 ===\n尝试: http://kjt.fujian.gov.cn/\n未找到有效公告，尝试其他选择器...\n成功获取 5 条公告\n\n\n=== 最终结果 ===\n\n\n## 厦门市人力资源和社会保障局\n1. 文明停车新方式，信用出行更便捷——市人社局开展信用停车宣传 | 2026-02-10 | http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/202602/t20260210_2981101.htm\n2. 聚焦诚信宣传 共建社会诚信体系 | 2025-12-08 | http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/202512/t20251208_2970714.htm\n3. 诚信用工承诺助力守护新业态劳动者权益 | 2025-10-29 | http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/202510/t20251029_2963574.htm\n4. 厦门市人社局：以“社保服务进万家”为契机 深化信用诚信宣传教育 | 2025-10-27 | http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/202510/t20251027_2962609.htm\n5. 厦门技师学院开展诚信教育活动 | 2025-09-18 | http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/202509/t20250918_2956361.htm\n\n## 厦门科学技术局\n1. 厦门市科学技术局关于开展2026年度新技术新产品应用场景征集的通知 | 2026-03-09 | http://sti.xm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202603/t20260309_2984616.htm\n2. 厦门市科学技术局关于转发福建省科学技术厅开展技术合同认定登记服务点申报的通知 | 2026-03-09 | http://sti.xm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202603/t20260309_2984385.htm\n3. 关于开展2026年《厦门市加快推进生物医药产业高质量发展若干措施》兑现工作的通知 | 2026-03-06 | http://sti.xm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202603/t20260306_2984321.htm\n4. 厦门市科学技术局关于印发《关于支持企业加强研发活动加大研发投入的若干措施》的通知 | 2026-03-06 | http://sti.xm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202603/t20260306_2984248.htm\n5. 厦门市高新技术企业认定专项工作组关于开展2026年国家级高新技术企业名称变更工作的通知 | 2026-03-05 | http://sti.xm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202603/t20260305_2984102.htm\n\n## 福建省科技厅\n1. 省人大常委会党组及机关党组（扩大）会议召开 | 2026-03-14 | http://www.fujian.gov.cn/xwdt/fjyw/202603/t20260314_7110218.htm\n2. 省侨联十一届四次全委会议召开 | 2026-03-14 | http://www.fujian.gov.c